-> HAS_FACET [node:c3dc31be-39b3-4422-a4f6-41136bfb48aa] @ 2026-09-08T09:36:59.394279+00:00
-> ABOUT [node:f29aa338-eddb-456b-97ad-00b602cb9a42] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:12.095896+00:00

The Google refresh token and the Kilo Gateway key are server-side only and never reach the frontend or the iPad. Varlock manages .env by schema, so agents see the schema and never the values, and secrets must not leak into GlitchTip payloads alongside errors - which is critical precisely because the AI chat logs every call.
