AI traffic goes through Kilo Gateway: models are addressed as provider/model-name, GET /models is unauthenticated and returns the model list with pricing and context window, and usage.prompt_tokens/completion_tokens in each response is what per-call cost is computed from and logged to the ai_calls table alongside session and model.
