Page — An ordered screenful of Cards within a Layout, and the unit a swipe moves between. Each Page carries its own grid, so adding Cards costs a new Page rather than shrinking the ones already on screen. Not a Slideshow, which rotates whole Cards full-screen after a period of inactivity and is driven by idleness rather than by touch; a Page is always visible, is changed deliberately, and is never nested. Not a DashboardGrid either - the grid is what a Page contains, not what it is.
