weight: 0.0
polarity: 1
source: agent-surface
created_at: 2026-09-09T06:22:37.945065+00:00

cost two retries of a headless phase: the truthiness guard and the implicit-row grid each fail with no error, so the phase verified false twice before the cause was visible
