src/server/index.ts is one flat file with every route registered inline (no routes/ directory, no plugin split) — weather, shopping-list, health, layout, theme.css, the error handler and static serving all live in this one module. Faza 3 (recipes/shopping-list) and Faza 5 (image widgets) sibling agents edit this same file concurrently, so any addition here must be a minimal, additive block (new routes appended near the existing ones, no reordering or refactor) to keep the three branches mergeable independently.
