K7Recipes.svelte's review-before-save UI reuses the same field shapes for both the import-then-edit flow and manual entry ("+ RECZNIE" opens the same review form with empty fields, sourceUrl: null) — one review form, two ways to reach it, rather than a separate manual-add form. ZAPISZ is the card's single solid-amber control (the design system's one-per-card budget); IMPORTUJ, + RECZNIE, ANULUJ and the delete "x" are all ghost controls. This closes the plan-review agent's minor finding that the plan hadn't stated explicitly which control carries the solid-amber budget within K7Recipes itself.
