-> HAS_FACET [node:68b03a85-d372-45c5-80a4-549ebf826798] @ 2026-09-09T12:16:43.227021+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:a1174884-8d33-4260-af5b-0f97264a2ea2] @ 2026-09-09T12:16:43.227021+00:00

K7Chat.svelte shows the user's own typed message immediately on send, before the server confirms it, unlike K7ShoppingList's strictly server-confirmed writes. This is a deliberate, scoped exception: the shopping list's no-optimistic-UI rule exists because multiple devices can race on the same list, and a chat turn has exactly one author typing into their own card with nothing to race against, so there is no data-consistency hazard an optimistic echo could hide.
