Open product question for k7-card-fullscreen, not yet decided: the calendar card ("kalendarz") is also one of the existing Slideshow's cardIds (layout.yaml's "pokaz-domowy" rotates zegar/pogoda/kalendarz/audiometr). A per-card manual fullscreen button and the Slideshow's own idle-driven fullscreen promotion would compete for the same underlying mechanism (CSS class + position:fixed on the same element, shared z-index space, one Pager to suspend) — if the household manually fullscreens the calendar and then the Slideshow's idle timer also fires, or vice versa, the two controllers are not coordinated today. Needs a decision at plan time: e.g. manual fullscreen resets/pauses the Slideshow idle timer for its duration, or the two share one "currently promoted card" lock that the later one refuses to override.
---
