-> HAS_FACET [node:e12ca220-5f82-4226-a2eb-9964701f03c4] @ 2026-09-14T20:23:39.250641+00:00

Decided 2026-09-14: a shared Svelte store (not a CustomEvent bridge) is the mechanism by which a card's fullscreen trait, running inside its own custom element's shadow root, reaches the page-level Pager singleton main.ts owns. The store carries which card (if any) is currently manually fullscreened; main.ts's pager-owning code and the fullscreen trait both import it directly, avoiding a DOM-event round trip for something that is really just shared module state within one JS bundle.
---
