Plan decision for k7-multi-calendar: the calendar card's `editable` config field is removed rather than kept alongside the new multi-calendar shape. Editability was never independently meaningful -- it's intrinsic to a Calendar's source (Google is read-write, .ics is read-only, per the CalendarEvent definition correction c4994962) -- so keeping it as a separate configurable field would let a layout author set it inconsistently with what's actually true. It becomes derived (source.mode === 'google') rather than configured.
